    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1074-a1">

                <pb facs="1006" n="748" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg748"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Secretary of State for Foreign Affairs</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grey</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the American
                        Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 30015/15</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">File copy
                                undated</hi></date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: With reference to your
                    excellency’s note of the 4th instant, relative to the detention of August
                    Piepenbrink, a German subject, who was taken prisoner by the French cruiser <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Condé</hi> out of the United States steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Windber</hi> and is at present detained at Kingston,
                    Jamaica, I have the honour to inform your excellency that His Majesty’s.
                    Government, in common with the French Government, have decided to liberate this
                    man as a friendly act, while reserving the question of principle involved.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Law</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
